  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>76</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mo>tan</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).<br>Chiều cao của cái tháp là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>76</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>76</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).</li><li>Ta có diện tích tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>76</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>58</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msup><mi/><mn>2</mn></msup></semantics></math>).</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>76</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.<br>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông cân tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>K</mi></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>5</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>65</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).<br>Vậy độ dài dây điện cần chuẩn bị bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>76</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>86</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).</li></ol>",
